  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The contact surface design of the plastic button ornaments for Shoe Charms ensures secure attachment to the shoe, aiming to prevent discomfort during extended wear of the assembled decoration. Additionally, separating the injection-molded buckle from the printed shoe charms provides greater freedom in 3D model sizes and allows for more flexible buckle designs. Please note that during use, side A should snugly fit against the foot, while side B is intended for connecting the design model."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Lightweight and portable, sturdy and durable, waterproof and not easy to break | Bonds to ornament with glue, easy to install in your DIY model"
    }
  ],
