align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"> <img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-mce-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> 3D Model </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"><br/></h2>\n<p>The contact surface design of the plastic button ornaments for Shoe Charms ensures secure attachment to the shoe, aiming to prevent discomfort during extended wear of the assembled decoration. Additionally, separating the injection-molded buckle from the printed shoe charms provides greater freedom in 3D model sizes and allows for more flexible buckle designs. Please note that during use, side A should snugly fit against the foot, while side B is intended for connecting the design model.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"><br/></h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\" style=\"padding: 10px!important; background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\" style=\"text-a